  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`e`](https://processes.openeo.org/#e) \u2014 *Euler's number (e)*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `e`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nThe real number *e* is a mathematical constant that is the base of the natural logarithm such that *`ln(e) = 1`*. The numerical value is approximately *2.71828*.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`e`](https://processes.openeo.org/#e) ([openeo-processes/e.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/e.json)).\n",
